1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,140
This puzzle looks like a crossword...

2
00:00:02,420 --> 00:00:04,100
but it's made of MATH!

3
00:00:04,840 --> 00:00:05,820
Cross Math!

4
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:09,060
Equations go across...

5
00:00:09,720 --> 00:00:10,560
and down...

6
00:00:11,060 --> 00:00:12,360
and they cross each other!

7
00:00:12,360 --> 00:00:14,740
See an empty box?

8
00:00:15,120 --> 00:00:15,660
Tap it!

9
00:00:17,240 --> 00:00:20,860
Now tap a number tile below — it jumps right in!

10
00:00:21,960 --> 00:00:24,740
When a whole line is correct, it glows green!

11
00:00:25,560 --> 00:00:30,000
But careful — every tile can be used only once!

12
00:00:31,580 --> 00:00:34,700
Fill every box to finish the level — three stars!

13
00:00:36,060 --> 00:00:36,660
Stuck?

14
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:40,680
No problem — you get three hints on every level!

15
00:00:41,380 --> 00:00:44,040
And there are two hundred levels to conquer!

16
00:00:45,820 --> 00:00:51,340
Parents — this builds math fluency and logic together, in one puzzle!

17
00:00:52,290 --> 00:00:58,900
Find it in the app — tap Math Game Zone, pick Cross Math, choose your level, and play!

18
00:00:58,900 --> 00:01:04,020
Abacus Kids — free on the App Store and Google Play!
